<title>USA: Carnival Corp Q3 Aug 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Carnival Corp Q3 Aug 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.92		    $0.74</p>
<p> Net		 268,100		  209,500</p>
<p> Revs		772,000		  672,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  291,171		  285,027</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.56		    $1.29</p>
<p> Net		 451,500		  366,900</p>
<p> Revs		1,737,600		1,545,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  288,524		  283,921</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income includes gains from litigation settlements relating to Wartsila Marine bankruptcy. The litigation gain in the third quarter of 1996, net of a loss on the sale of notes receivable from the sale of Crystal Palace, was $16.1 million. The litigation gain in the third quarter of 1995 was $14.4 million.</p>
